  {
    "id": "t-link-telemetry-insights",
    "kind": "link",
    "label": "derives-from",
    "metadata": {
      "netId": "scout",
      "sessionId": "dev-support-council"
    },
    "postsets": {
      "to": {
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-insights"
      }
    },
    "presets": {
      "from": {
        "arcql": "FROM $ LIMIT 1",
        "consume": false,
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "optional": true,
        "placeId": "p-scout-telemetry",
        "take": "FIRST"
      }
    },
    "relation": "derives-from"
  },
  {
    "action": {
      "autoEmit": true,
      "capabilityProfile": "research-worker",
      "maxIterations": 4,
      "model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud",
      "modelId": "research-scout",
      "nl": "You classify ONE article for a research brief. You do NOT count, date, or route anything — those are already computed and must be copied through verbatim.\n\nDOMAIN: ${config.data.topic}\n${config.data.domainHint}\n\nARTICLE\nurl: ${input.data.url}\ntitle: ${input.data.title}\nextract: ${input.data.extract}\n\nAssign EXACTLY ONE category, using one of these strings verbatim:\n${config.data.categories}\n\nIf none fits, use \"unrelated\". Prefer an existing category over inventing a near-duplicate.\n\nYour FINAL answer must be exactly one JSON object, no markdown fences:\n{\"url\":\"${input.data.url}\",\"recency\":\"${input.data.recency}\",\"publishedAt\":\"${input.data.publishedAt}\",\"title\":\"${input.data.title}\",\"category\":\"...\",\"summary\":\"one or two sentences on the angle it takes\",\"keyPoints\":[\"...\",\"...\"],\"confidence\":\"high|medium|low\"}\n\nCopy url, recency, publishedAt and title EXACTLY as given. Do not recompute them.",
      "role": "rw-h-",
      "timeoutMs": 240000,
      "type": "agent"
    },
    "id": "t-scout-categorize",
    "kind": "agent",
    "label": "Categorise one article (domain from brief)",
    "metadata": {
      "netId": "scout",
      "sessionId": "dev-support-council"
    },
    "mode": "SINGLE",
    "postsets": {
      "out": {
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-analysis"
      }
    },
    "presets": {
      "config": {
        "arcql": "FROM $ WHERE $.active == \"true\" LIMIT 1",
        "consume": false,
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "optional": false,
        "placeId": "p-scout-brief",
        "take": "FIRST"
      },
      "input": {
        "arcql": "FROM $ LIMIT 1",
        "consume": true,
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-candidates",
        "take": "FIRST"
      }
    },
    "role": "rw-h-"
  },
  {
    "action": {
      "autoEmit": true,
      "capabilityProfile": "research-worker",
      "maxIterations": 3,
      "model": "deepseek-v4-pro:cloud",
      "modelId": "research-scout",
      "nl": "You are an analyst working this brief:\n\nTOPIC: ${config.data.topic}\n${config.data.description}\n\nBelow are FACTS already computed deterministically from a crawl of the sources. Every number is measured. Do NOT recount, re-derive, or estimate any figure — quote them exactly as given. If a number you want is not present, say so rather than inventing it.\n\nFACTS\n${input.data.factsJson}\n\nWrite the analysis. Cover:\n1. Which angles the sources clearly OWN — categories with the most coverage, and who leads each.\n2. FRESHNESS — who publishes recently versus sits on ageing content, using the brand-new/recent/archive split.\n3. GAPS — categories and angles thinly covered or absent, i.e. the openings worth taking.\n4. Three concrete recommendations, each naming the gap it exploits and the source it targets.\n\nBe specific. Name sources by host. No preamble, no restating the brief.\n\nYour FINAL answer must be exactly one JSON object, no markdown fences:\n{\"kind\":\"landscape-analysis\",\"generatedAt\":\"${input.data.generatedAt}\",\"totalFindings\":\"${input.data.totalFindings}\",\"ownedAngles\":\"...\",\"freshness\":\"...\",\"gaps\":\"...\",\"recommendations\":[\"...\",\"...\",\"...\"]}",
      "role": "rw-h-",
      "timeoutMs": 300000,
      "type": "agent"
    },
    "id": "t-scout-digest",
    "kind": "agent",
    "label": "Landscape analysis (interprets facts only)",
    "metadata": {
      "netId": "scout",
      "sessionId": "dev-support-council"
    },
    "mode": "SINGLE",
    "postsets": {
      "out": {
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-digest",
        "retain": 3
      }
    },
    "presets": {
      "config": {
        "arcql": "FROM $ WHERE $.active == \"true\" LIMIT 1",
        "consume": false,
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "optional": false,
        "placeId": "p-scout-brief",
        "take": "FIRST"
      },
      "input": {
        "arcql": "FROM $ WHERE $.kind == \"facts\" LIMIT 1",
        "consume": true,
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-taxonomy",
        "take": "FIRST"
      }
    },
    "role": "rw-h-"
  },
  {
    "action": {
      "await": "ALL",
      "dispatch": [
        {
          "channel": "default",
          "executor": "bash"
        }
      ],
      "executorId": "agentic-net-executor-default",
      "groupBy": "executor",
      "inputPlace": "input",
      "timeoutMs": 180000,
      "type": "command"
    },
    "emit": [
      {
        "from": "@result",
        "to": "log"
      }
    ],
    "id": "t-scout-fetch",
    "kind": "command",
    "label": "Fetch page on executor",
    "metadata": {
      "netId": "scout",
      "sessionId": "dev-support-council"
    },
    "mode": "SINGLE",
    "postsets": {
      "log": {
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-raw"
      }
    },
    "presets": {
      "input": {
        "arcql": "FROM $ LIMIT 1",
        "consume": true,
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-fetch-cmd",
        "take": "FIRST"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "action": {
      "template": {
        "args": {
          "argv": [],
          "env": {
            "ATTEMPT": "${input.data.attempt}",
            "BRIEF_JSON": "${json(config.data)}",
            "DEPTH": "${input.data.depth}",
            "MODEL_ID": "research-scout",
            "URL": "${input.data.url}"
          },
          "timeoutMs": 120000,
          "toolId": "scout-fetch"
        },
        "command": "invoke",
        "executor": "script",
        "expect": "text",
        "id": "fetch-${input._meta.id}",
        "kind": "command"
      },
      "type": "map"
    },
    "emit": [
      {
        "from": "@response",
        "to": "out"
      }
    ],
    "id": "t-scout-fetch-cmd",
    "kind": "map",
    "label": "Build fetch CommandToken",
    "metadata": {
      "netId": "scout",
      "sessionId": "dev-support-council"
    },
    "mode": "FOREACH",
    "postsets": {
      "out": {
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-fetch-cmd"
      }
    },
    "presets": {
      "config": {
        "arcql": "FROM $ LIMIT 1",
        "consume": false,
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "optional": false,
        "placeId": "p-scout-brief",
        "take": "FIRST"
      },
      "input": {
        "arcql": "FROM $ WHERE $.depth < 3 LIMIT 5",
        "consume": true,
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-frontier",
        "take": "ALL"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "action": {
      "template": {
        "ageDays": "${input.data.ageDays}",
        "blobUrn": "${input.data.blobUrn}",
        "briefId": "${input.data.briefId}",
        "dateSource": "${input.data.dateSource}",
        "depth": "${input.data.depth}",
        "extract": "${input.data.extract}",
        "extractChars": "${input.data.extractChars}",
        "gateVerdict": "${input.data.gateVerdict}",
        "gatedAt": "${now()}",
        "host": "${input.data.host}",
        "pageType": "${input.data.pageType}",
        "publishedAt": "${input.data.publishedAt}",
        "recency": "${input.data.recency}",
        "score": "${input.data.score}",
        "title": "${input.data.title}",
        "url": "${input.data.url}"
      },
      "type": "map"
    },
    "emit": [
      {
        "from": "@response",
        "to": "scout_candidates",
        "when": "gateVerdict == 'pass'"
      },
      {
        "from": "@response",
        "to": "scout_rejected",
        "when": "gateVerdict == 'low-score'"
      },
      {
        "from": "@response",
        "to": "scout_rejected",
        "when": "gateVerdict == 'index'"
      }
    ],
    "id": "t-scout-gate",
    "kind": "map",
    "label": "Gate: articles above minScore only",
    "metadata": {
      "netId": "scout",
      "sessionId": "dev-support-council"
    },
    "mode": "SINGLE",
    "postsets": {
      "scout_candidates": {
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-candidates"
      },
      "scout_rejected": {
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-rejected"
      }
    },
    "presets": {
      "input": {
        "arcql": "FROM $ LIMIT 1",
        "consume": true,
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-fetched",
        "take": "FIRST"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "action": {
      "await": "ALL",
      "dispatch": [
        {
          "channel": "default",
          "executor": "bash"
        }
      ],
      "executorId": "agentic-net-executor-default",
      "groupBy": "executor",
      "inputPlace": "input",
      "timeoutMs": 120000,
      "type": "command"
    },
    "emit": [
      {
        "from": "@result",
        "to": "log"
      }
    ],
    "id": "t-scout-health",
    "kind": "command",
    "label": "Roll telemetry into insights",
    "metadata": {
      "netId": "scout",
      "sessionId": "dev-support-council"
    },
    "mode": "SINGLE",
    "postsets": {
      "log": {
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-health-log"
      }
    },
    "presets": {
      "input": {
        "arcql": "FROM $ LIMIT 1",
        "consume": true,
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-health-cmd",
        "take": "FIRST"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "action": {
      "template": {
        "args": {
          "argv": [],
          "env": {
            "MODEL_ID": "research-scout",
            "WINDOW": "2000"
          },
          "timeoutMs": 90000,
          "toolId": "scout-health"
        },
        "command": "invoke",
        "executor": "script",
        "expect": "text",
        "id": "health-${now()}",
        "kind": "command"
      },
      "type": "map"
    },
    "emit": [
      {
        "from": "@response",
        "to": "out"
      }
    ],
    "id": "t-scout-health-cmd",
    "kind": "map",
    "label": "Build health CommandToken",
    "metadata": {
      "netId": "scout",
      "sessionId": "dev-support-council"
    },
    "mode": "SINGLE",
    "postsets": {
      "out": {
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-health-cmd"
      }
    },
    "presets": {
      "input": {
        "arcql": "FROM $ LIMIT 1",
        "consume": false,
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "optional": false,
        "placeId": "p-scout-brief",
        "take": "FIRST"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "action": {
      "template": {
        "ageDays": "${input.data.parsedStdout.ageDays}",
        "attempt": "${input.data.parsedStdout.attempt}",
        "blobUrn": "${input.data.parsedStdout.blobUrn}",
        "briefId": "${input.data.parsedStdout.briefId}",
        "dateSource": "${input.data.parsedStdout.dateSource}",
        "depth": "${input.data.parsedStdout.depth}",
        "durationMs": "${input.data.parsedStdout.durationMs}",
        "extract": "${input.data.parsedStdout.extract}",
        "extractChars": "${input.data.parsedStdout.extractChars}",
        "failureClass": "${input.data.parsedStdout.failureClass}",
        "frontierCandidates": "${input.data.parsedStdout.frontierCandidates}",
        "gateVerdict": "${input.data.parsedStdout.gateVerdict}",
        "host": "${input.data.parsedStdout.host}",
        "httpStatus": "${input.data.parsedStdout.httpStatus}",
        "linksFound": "${input.data.parsedStdout.linksFound}",
        "outcome": "${input.data.parsedStdout.outcome}",
        "pageType": "${input.data.parsedStdout.pageType}",
        "publishedAt": "${input.data.parsedStdout.publishedAt}",
        "queuedAt": "${now()}",
        "recency": "${input.data.parsedStdout.recency}",
        "retry": "${input.data.parsedStdout.retry}",
        "score": "${input.data.parsedStdout.score}",
        "spoolQueued": "${input.data.parsedStdout.spoolQueued}",
        "title": "${input.data.parsedStdout.title}",
        "ts": "${input.data.parsedStdout.ts}",
        "url": "${input.data.parsedStdout.url}"
      },
      "type": "map"
    },
    "emit": [
      {
        "from": "@response",
        "to": "scout_fetched",
        "when": "outcome == 'ok'"
      },
      {
        "fanOut": true,
        "from": "@response.frontierCandidates",
        "to": "scout_frontier"
      },
      {
        "from": "@response",
        "to": "scout_frontier",
        "when": "retry == 'yes'"
      },
      {
        "from": "@response",
        "to": "out"
      }
    ],
    "id": "t-scout-lift",
    "kind": "map",
    "label": "Lift result, telemeter, route, fan out discovered links",
    "metadata": {
      "netId": "scout",
      "sessionId": "dev-support-council"
    },
    "mode": "SINGLE",
    "postsets": {
      "out": {
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-telemetry",
        "retain": 500
      },
      "scout_fetched": {
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-fetched"
      },
      "scout_frontier": {
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-frontier"
      }
    },
    "presets": {
      "input": {
        "arcql": "FROM $ LIMIT 1",
        "consume": true,
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-raw",
        "take": "FIRST"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "action": {
      "template": {
        "blobUrn": "${input.data.blobUrn}",
        "briefId": "${input.data.briefId}",
        "category": "${input.data.category}",
        "confidence": "${input.data.confidence}",
        "filedAt": "${now()}",
        "keyPoints": "${input.data.keyPoints}",
        "publishedAt": "${input.data.publishedAt}",
        "recency": "${input.data.recency}",
        "summary": "${input.data.summary}",
        "title": "${input.data.title}",
        "url": "${input.data.url}"
      },
      "type": "map"
    },
    "emit": [
      {
        "from": "@response",
        "to": "find_brand_new",
        "when": "recency == 'brand-new'"
      },
      {
        "from": "@response",
        "to": "find_recent",
        "when": "recency == 'recent'"
      },
      {
        "from": "@response",
        "to": "find_archive",
        "when": "recency == 'archive'"
      },
      {
        "from": "@response",
        "to": "malformed",
        "when": "recency == null"
      }
    ],
    "id": "t-scout-route",
    "kind": "map",
    "label": "Route by publication recency",
    "metadata": {
      "netId": "scout",
      "sessionId": "dev-support-council"
    },
    "mode": "SINGLE",
    "postsets": {
      "find_archive": {
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-find-archive"
      },
      "find_brand_new": {
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-find-brand-new"
      },
      "find_recent": {
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-find-recent"
      },
      "malformed": {
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-errors"
      }
    },
    "presets": {
      "input": {
        "arcql": "FROM $ LIMIT 1",
        "consume": true,
        "host": "research-scout@agentic-net-node:8080",
        "placeId": "p-scout-analysis",
        "take": "FIRST"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "action": {
      "await": "ALL",
      "dispatch": [
        {
          "channel": "default",
          "executor": "bash"
        }
      ],
      "executorId": "agentic-net-executor-default",
      "groupBy": "executor",
      "inputPlace": "input",
      "timeoutMs": 120000,
      "type": "command"
    },
    "emit": [
      {
        "from": "@result",
        "to": "log"
      }
    ],
